title
  Minecraft Everything Generator (Full-Style)

output
  {This|That} [entity] is so [adjective]!
  I wish I could [verb] that [entity].
  Aren't [entity.pluralForm] just so [adjective]?
  There must be at least {1-10} [entity]{s} [location]!
  THE [entity.upperCase]! It stole my [item] and ran into [biome]!
  {A} [entity] in [biome] near {a} [structure] holding {a} [item]… classic Minecraft.

